        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "It is the sequel to Gee Bee, which was released in the previous year.\n\nThe objective of the game is to use two paddles to bounce a ball which flies around and hit the colored bricks above it with the ball. When the bricks are cleared out of the side sections, it will turn that same side's pop-bumper into 100 points instead of 10.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Es la secuela de Gee Bee, lanzado el año anterior.\n\nEl objetivo del juego es usar dos palas para rebotar una pelota que vuela y golpear con ella los ladrillos de colores situados encima. Cuando se despejan los ladrillos de una sección lateral, el bumper de ese mismo lado pasa a valer 100 puntos en lugar de 10.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
